              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Instructions:\nClassify user input  {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}  into one intent: show_orders  or prioritize_order\n a. show_orders: Classify the intent as following if input contains \"Show me top n orders which are running late\" or \"\"All orders not shipping today\" or \"What orders are missing shipping today\" or something similar\n b. prioritize_order: Classify the intent as following if input contains anything related order prioritization. e.g Prioritize <Order123> or a simple order number\n c. assign_user: Classify the intent as following if input mentions about User ID and Order ID task. e.g. Assign <user id> to <order id> task\n d. show_task: Classify the intent as following if input contains \"Show me task for order <order_no>\" or \"Give task for order <order_no>\" or something similar\n e. other: Classify the intent as following if you are unable to classify input to any of the above option"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"Intent\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n    }\n}",
