          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1764762208923_1",
              "name": "returnValue",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "I have successfully assigned the {{$context.$nodes.DERIVEUSERANDORDER.$output.user_id}} to order {{$context.$nodes.DERIVEUSERANDORDER.$output.order_nbr}} having tasks {{$context.$nodes.COMBINETASKSFORUSER.$output.result.taskNbrArray}} \n\nIf you need further assistance, you can ask me to:\n\n- **Prioritize an order:**\n\"Prioritize Order {order number}\"\n\n- **Assign an order task to a user:**\n\"Assign Task for Order {order number} to User {user id}\"\n\n- **Show tasks associated with an order:**\n\"Show tasks for Order {order number}\""
