          "id": "1764822026497",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1764822026498_1",
              "name": "returnValue",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "As a WMS AI Task Management Agent, I can assist you with managing and prioritizing orders that have not yet shipped. For example, I can:\n\n<strong>Identify orders that haven’t shipped by today</strong> and provide their details.\n<strong>Detect any related tasks that are not yet completed</strong> and help increase their priority, ensuring orders are completed on time.\nIf no tasks exist for an order, <strong>increase the priority of the order itself</strong> to expedite processing.\n<strong>Assign a task to a user</strong> to ensure responsibilities are clear and progress is made.\nTo get started, you can ask me to show you the late orders.\n\nIf you need further assistance, please use one of the following commands:\n\n- **Prioritize an order:**  \n  \"Prioritize Order {order number}\"\n\n- **Assign an order task to a user:**  \n  \"Assign Task for Order {order number} to User {user id}\"\n\n- **Show tasks associated with an order:**  \n  \"Show tasks for Order {order number}\""
            }
          ],
          "type": "RETURN"
        },
